{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19104230","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19104230","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910423001:1":{"text":"触手男のやつ、なかなかやるぞ。狩りの手伝いなんていらなかったよ。それから、リトラには手を出してない。おいらが保証する。","source_cn":"触手男挺厉害，狩猎用不着咱帮忙——咱保证，他没有伤害浅海裔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01F3FFA7ED58A7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910423002:1":{"text":"暇だったからさ、水進機の修理や改良に使えそうな材料を探してみたんだ。そしたらその……巻貝を一個見つけたから、ついでに持ってきた。","source_cn":"闲着也是闲着，咱就去找了不少修理和改装水行器的材料。咳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A7C661C023AB7E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910423003:1":{"text":"たぶん……タラサで人気のやつ。","source_cn":"就是……在塔拉萨挺受欢迎的那种。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31D7143CB0D8A579","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910423004:1":{"text":"巻貝？もしかして……","source_cn":"海螺？你说的是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87F08ECBD364D025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910423005:0":{"text":"だ、だから……お前が、姉ちゃんにほしいってせがんでたやつだよ。","source_cn":"……就……就你之前在家，缠着你姐想要的那种。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70FBA439C064C36C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910423006:0":{"text":"ほら……","source_cn":"喏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BFA15317FF279DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:7::0":{"text":"装饰海螺","source_cn":"装饰海螺","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x5BDAA27C8B1F9F99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910423007:0":{"text":"これ……月輪法螺（つきのわぼら）？","source_cn":"这是……月旋海螺？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70CF2AB80B3DA369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910423008:1":{"text":"珊瑚礁の奥深くにしかなくて、とっても珍しくて貴重な貝なんだって、お姉ちゃんが言ってた。","source_cn":"姐姐说这种海螺只有在珊瑚丛深处才能找到，很稀少也很珍贵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDF0D7CDF5A50F5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910423009:1":{"text":"オットー、もしかして……あたしのために、わざわざ……？","source_cn":"图澜，这个……是特意找来给我的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91EABACE33001FA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910423010:1":{"text":"ち、ちげえよ……ただ、材料を探してたら、たまたま……ついでに見つけたっていうか……","source_cn":"也……也不是特意……咱就是找改造材料的时候……顺便找到的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E9E81577ADA0D0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1910423010":{"text":"ち、ちげえよ……ただ、材料を探してたら、たまたま……ついでに見つけたっていうか……","source_cn":"也……也不是特意……咱就是找改造材料的时候……顺便找到的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E9E81577ADA0D0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910423011:1":{"text":"のっぽ、てめえ……！","source_cn":"……大个子！你——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x49A08E9C8437C828","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"のっぽ、てめえ……！","female":"のっぽ、てめえ……！","variant_male_record_index":"294554","variant_female_record_index":"294555","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910423012:1":{"text":"うん、分かってるよ。「ついでに」持って帰ってきたんだよね。","source_cn":"嗯，我知道了，海螺是你“顺便”带回来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17D03E3645ED9460","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910423013:0":{"text":"とにかく、せっかく拾ったんだから……お前にやるよ。","source_cn":"总之就捡到了……你拿着吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E6FAEEE22C6EA29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910423014:0":{"text":"本当にいいの？ありがとう、オットー！すっごく気に入ったよ！","source_cn":"真的给我吗？我很喜欢。谢谢你，图澜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36C9D93F0C4338F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:18::0":{"text":"小玩具车","source_cn":"小玩具车","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xED897AB059DE8310","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910423015:1":{"text":"べ、別に、巻貝の一個ぐらい。他にも、水進機に使えそうなもんをいっぱい見つけてきたからな。ほら――","source_cn":"反正……咱找到了不少能用来修理和改造水行器的玩意儿，也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2EAAF1350BE3F1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910423016:1":{"text":"わっ、こんなにたくさん！あれ？ちょっと待って、これって……","source_cn":"你找到了好多物资呀。咦，等一下，这是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8F3B7486E4DEA2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910423017:0":{"text":"すごいよ、オットー！これ、白波貝（しろなみがい））だよ！","source_cn":"……哇，你找到了白汐母贝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E452BA874A9FC98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1910423017":{"text":"すごいよ、オットー！これ、白波貝（しろなみがい））だよ！","source_cn":"……哇，你找到了白汐母贝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E452BA874A9FC98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910423018:1":{"text":"すっごく珍しい貝なの。見て、普通の貝よりずっと真珠の輝きがきれいでしょ？ばあばが言ってたんだけど、何百年も生きた貝だけが、こんなに美しくてエネルギー豊かな真珠層を作れるんだって。","source_cn":"是一种非常稀有的贝壳。看，它的珠光比普通贝壳漂亮很多吧...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2C578BE3E37020C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910423019:1":{"text":"あたしたちのところでは、一番の高級品だよ。たぶん、これ一つで巻貝小屋一棟と交換できるかも！","source_cn":"这算是我们那里价值最高的贵重品啦，说不定……能换一整座...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA34503D4522E485","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910423020:1":{"text":"……そんなに貴重な貝なのか？","source_cn":"……这贝壳这么贵重？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x363CEDE250D3AC2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910423021:1":{"text":"うん！だから大事に持っておいてね。タラサに戻ったら――","source_cn":"是呀，你可要好好放起来，千万别丢了。等回了塔拉萨——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA9FC04A7C46AA78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910423022:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910423023:1":{"text":"いや、タラサにはもう戻らねえよ。","source_cn":"咱……不回塔拉萨了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7696964A2BECE1D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1910423024:1":{"text":"ここは静かだし、作業も捗りそうだ。のっぽ、あとで水進機を元の大きさに戻してくれるか？そろそろ修理を始めねえと。","source_cn":"这里挺安静，适合干活。大个子，等会儿帮咱把水行器变回原...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD53DB5C1D23E6C4B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ここは静かだし、作業も捗りそうだ。のっぽ、あとで水進機を元の大きさに戻してくれるか？そろそろ修理を始めねえと。","female":"ここは静かだし、作業も捗りそうだ。のっぽ、あとで水進機を元の大きさに戻してくれるか？そろそろ修理を始めねえと。","variant_male_record_index":"294567","variant_female_record_index":"294568","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1910423025:1":{"text":"直ったら……おいらは、陸に戻る。","source_cn":"等修好了……咱就打算回岸上去。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7EF652AF2DF109DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"直ったら……おいらは、陸に戻る。","female":"直ったら……おいらは、陸に戻る。","variant_male_record_index":"294569","variant_female_record_index":"294570","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1910423026:1":{"text":"オットー……","source_cn":"……图澜……你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D9CEDEE9EAED487","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1910423027:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_t